red, and Elohim.. Which to say is a very interesting combination. I'd assume most of the base lore from V:TM and D:TF doesn't change much at all and Buffy would just be an Imbued who has gained Second Sight. Also I'd make it as there is no &quot;Hell&quot; because the Elohim were never sent to Hell, only the Abyss. Also after the first crossover book, I'd do a second one where a new splat is introduced involving Angels instead of Demons. That'll get really get interesting..<br /> <br /> I'll take the next shot: What if Werewolf: The Apocalypse took place in the Resident Evil universe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}